  "title": "Jerky Roast Turkey – Jerk Spice Thanksgiving Turkey",
  "description": "Turkey breast is marinated in a jerk chicken marinade with just the right amount of heat that is beautifully balanced by brown sugar Add some sweet potatoes to your pan to make a complete meal.",
